I'll keep you safe, I swear.

163
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:12,251
You're risking your life?

164
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,360
For me?

165
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,860
For the Kozuki?

166
