177
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:22,060
The speech you gave that
day brought me to tears.

178
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:33,800
More than that, Kozuki Oden's
way of life has inspired me!

179
00:13:57,780 --> 00:14:02,080
Momonosuke, on that terrible
day, I had hoped to save you,

180
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:06,160
so I ran to Kuri.

181
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,780
Wait, you're okay?

182
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,360
But in the end,

183
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:17,120
