Kaido held you over the edge of the castle.

184
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:19,940
I'm sorry I failed you.

185
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:37,520
I was weak, but not now, not anymore!

186
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,300
Huh?

187
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:02,680
Who are you, really? Tell me!

188
