192
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:15,250
Yamato!

193
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:26,840
And I shall lay down my life for you!

194
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:32,840
Damn you, Marco!

195
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:39,460
I don't know my role in this story
yet, but I do know your bad news!

196
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:43,857
You're the last thing Straw Hat and
his allies need to deal with right now!

197
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:44,770
Ha!

198
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:49,990
Hey!

199
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:51,434
Come here, Prometheus!

200
