I'll show you!

211
00:16:39,780 --> 00:16:41,900
Ma-ma-ma-ma!

212
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:44,360
I've got you now, bird brain.

213
00:16:44,740 --> 00:16:46,799
Should've minded your own business.

214
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:50,080
Now, pettispatto, shoot him down!

215
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:54,120
Mama, look.

216
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,820
I do apologize to you, Marco.

217
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:07,440
Our Lickety Alliance was short-lived.

218
00:17:08,860 --> 00:17:10,537
Well, this sucks.

219
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:13,973
I once longed to kill you,
but now it's just a formality.

220
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,820
Oh, how ironic.

221
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,390
Ha-ha!

222
00:17:23,473 --> 00:17:24,303
Daddy!

223
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:33,740
Wade!

224
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:44,810
You!

225
00:17:44,893 --> 00:17:47,460
You're the one who attacked us last time!

226
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:51,240
So you're here to thwart
me again, are you?

227
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,720
Is this the man?

228
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,182
Pedro's killer?

229
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:57,618
It's all his fault.

230
00:17:57,760 --> 00:17:59,320
He deserves to suffer.

231
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,560
Don't blame me.

232
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,360
That idiot blew himself up.

233
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,120
It's like he's harassing
me from the damn afterlife.

234
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:08,040
This is my task.

235
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:11,772
This is the road that Pedro
set out for me and my friends.

236
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,060
Hugh Karoo.

237
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:19,107
We must keep moving forward!

238
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:22,580
What a pain in the ass.

239
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:27,260
