264
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,500
Let's finish this.

265
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,880
That's fine with me.

266
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:07,740
I've always hated him.

267
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,480
I don't care!

268
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:11,660
I hate you too!

269
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:15,540
That's a real dick move, Drake.

270
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:21,989
Spying wasn't enough, so you
gotta be a straight-up traitor.

271
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:23,420
I see.

272
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:26,500
That's Roro Noa Zoro.

273
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:29,877
The Straw Hats have a couple
of big shots in the crew.

274
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:33,725
We had better take them down
before they cause any more trouble.

275
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:36,240
Wade, that's Judge's son.

276
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:38,040
He's with Straw Hat?

277
00:20:38,260 --> 00:20:41,080
His family is the face
of Jeremiah Double Six.

278
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:43,000
And one of them is here?

279
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:44,670
Interesting.

280
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:48,080
As it turns out, I'm fine.

281
00:20:48,740 --> 00:20:50,220
I mean, look at me.

282
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,260
No horns, nothing.

283
00:20:54,300 --> 00:20:55,380
What a relief.

284
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:59,077
Your body temperature can't go
down because you're all bones.

285
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:01,042
You're cold as a corpse already.

286
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:02,180
I see.

287
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:04,520
That makes sense. Yes.

288
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:08,489
Why, I don't have any flesh or
organs for that matter, do I?

289
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:11,820
Even a fatal illness is
no threat to a corpse.

290
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:17,560
Wow, that is depressing.

291
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:19,260
But I'm invincible.

292
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:21,920
Wait a sec.

293
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:27,057
Brooke is a skeleton, so his temperature
didn't change when he was infected.

294
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:28,820
Also, the ice didn't spread.

295
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:32,677
That means the virus must be
spreading through the ice.

296
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:33,760
It's multiplying.

297
00:21:34,220 --> 00:21:36,700
It happens because their body gets cold.

298
00:21:37,460 --> 00:21:40,637
So then, we have to
maintain their temperature.

299
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:45,560
All right, but how is it freezing
their body from the inside?

300
00:21:46,940 --> 00:21:50,080
Maybe I was wrong about how it works.

301
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:53,100
Chopper, your arm! What's happening?

302
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,560
How did I not notice?

303
00:21:59,040 --> 00:21:59,870
Oh, no!

304
00:21:59,953 --> 00:22:01,056
How did they get me?

305
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,380
All is lost!

306
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,500
Chopper's gonna die!

307
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:11,520
Special attack, Green Star!

308
00:22:12,300 --> 00:22:13,130
Shibble!

309
00:22:19,120 --> 00:22:21,140
Ew, ew, gross!

310
00:22:22,860 --> 00:22:23,690
Gotcha!

311
00:22:23,773 --> 00:22:24,603
Hell yeah!

312
00:22:24,686 --> 00:22:28,574
If you can't beat them, dissolve them
with digestive fluid, I always say!

313
00:22:30,820 --> 00:22:35,437
This stuff is nasty and
sticky, and I hate it!

314
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:37,400
Help me, baby!

315
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:40,440
Oh, baby!

316
00:22:45,260 --> 00:22:48,020
You could have freed yourself, you whiner.

317
00:22:49,140 --> 00:22:50,400
No fear!

318
00:22:54,380 --> 00:22:57,100
Oh, baby, you're my hero!

319
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:01,557
Get off of me, you're
covered in slime, you maniac!

320
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,900
No fear!

321
00:23:04,560 --> 00:23:05,960
Let's try this one!

322
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:11,260
Bambu-chamalain!

323
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:19,520
That attack was so basic.

324
00:23:25,220 --> 00:23:28,337
No more games.

325
00:23:28,420 --> 00:23:32,460
Because I am done playing around!

326
00:23:44,380 --> 00:23:45,440
Ultimortar!

327
00:23:45,700 --> 00:23:46,640
Not again.

328
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:02,140
Hold on, Usopp.

329
00:24:03,360 --> 00:24:04,500
You're next, tramp.

330
00:24:06,060 --> 00:24:07,140
Don't kill me.

331
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:11,360
I can't fight back. It's over.
You beat me. You won this.

332
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:13,220
You totally defeated me.

333
00:24:13,380 --> 00:24:15,297
You think I don't know that already?

334
00:24:15,380 --> 00:24:17,640
You've wasted enough of my time.

335
00:24:18,180 --> 00:24:20,160
Now say it. Okay.

336
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:22,300
What do I say?

337
00:24:22,520 --> 00:24:24,900
I told you loud and clear, didn't I?

338
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:27,177
Your captain pissed me off,

339
00:24:27,260 --> 00:24:32,025
bragging about how he's going to beat
Commander Kaido and be King of the Pirates.

340
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:34,680
I'm sorry, you're right.

341
00:24:35,060 --> 00:24:36,300
Luffy's an idiot.

342
00:24:36,740 --> 00:24:38,480
And he talks too much.

343
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:41,660
Just don't headbutt me, I'm begging you.

344
00:24:42,340 --> 00:24:43,620
I'll do anything.

345
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:45,214
I'll leave the island.

346
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:48,180
If you hit me again, I'm done.

347
00:24:48,840 --> 00:24:50,060
I'll die.

348
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:52,460
I'll give you one last chance.

349
00:24:52,820 --> 00:24:54,577
Say it loud and clear.

350
00:24:54,660 --> 00:24:58,860
Say that your captain will
never be King of the Pirates!

351
00:25:05,700 --> 00:25:06,530
Fine.

352
00:25:06,613 --> 00:25:08,900
Luffy will...

353
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:17,177
Luffy will...

354
00:25:17,260 --> 00:25:19,417
He'll never...

355
00:25:19,500 --> 00:25:21,760
Never be able to...

356
00:25:24,100 --> 00:25:25,540
That's it, Nami.

357
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,397
It's okay to lie.

358
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:29,737
The truth isn't worth dying for.

359
00:25:29,820 --> 00:25:31,937
Not after we've come this far.

360
00:25:32,020 --> 00:25:35,180
Just lie to her, whatever it takes.

361
00:25:37,660 --> 00:25:39,217
Luffy will...

362
00:25:39,300 --> 00:25:43,117
Luffy will never...

363
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:47,037
never give up.

364
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:48,920
Till he wins.

365
00:25:52,560 --> 00:25:57,100
So I'm sorry, he'll beat Kaido,

366
00:25:57,560 --> 00:26:00,560
and he'll become King of the Pirates!

367
00:26:03,660 --> 00:26:05,620
You had your chance.

368
00:26:05,980 --> 00:26:07,200
Now die.

369
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:12,520
Get away, Nami, you dope! Hurry!

370
00:26:12,780 --> 00:26:13,900
Oh, Nami!

371
00:26:17,520 --> 00:26:18,400
Go!

372
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,500
Coming to ya!

373
00:26:26,900 --> 00:26:27,980
The dog!

374
00:26:34,900 --> 00:26:36,120
What is that?

375
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:37,320
It's Otama!

376
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,540
What are you doing here?
